s\",\"slug\":\"wet-cans\",\"status\":\"active\",\"subCategory\":\"wet-cans\",\"sub_category\":\"wet-cans\",\"subcategory\":\"wet-cans\",\"subcategory_alt\":\"罐罐 / 濕糧\",\"subcategory_slug\":\"wet-cans\",\"tag\":\"貓咪商品\",\"tags\":\"貓咪商品\",\"type\":\"wet-cans\"}},{\"id\":\"prod_V5Cy3j6T15p2xK\",\"name\":\"CIAO 貓罐罐 - 雞肉, 黃金槍魚, 木魚乾 85g x6個\",\"description\":\"雞肉基底搭配黃金槍魚，再撒上香氣濃郁的木魚乾，打開罐蓋即是滿滿日式高湯氣息。層次分明的鮮味特別適合嗅覺靈敏、愛「聞香下飯」的活躍貓。可單獨享用，亦可淋在乾糧上瞬間升級成豪華濕食餐。\",\"image\":null,\"images\":[],\"priceId\":\"price_1U52Y7RyM6dRKLtZAo48GaSj\",\"unitAmount\":7800,\"currency\":\"hkd\",\"active\":true,\"metadata\":{\"id\":\"wt-product-8\",\"Categories\":\"貓咪商品\",\"Category\":\"貓咪商品\",\"Parent_Category\":\"貓咪商品\",\"SubCategory\":\"貓罐頭\",\"category\":\"cats\",\"category_slug\":\"cats\",\"child_category\":\"wet-cans\",\"is_active\":\"true\",\"parent_category\":\"cats\",\"slug\":\"wet-cans\",\"status\":\"active\",\"subCategory\":\"wet-cans\",\"sub_category\":\"wet-cans\",\"subcategory\":\"wet-cans\",\"subcategory_alt\":\"罐罐 / 濕糧\",\"subcategory_slug\":\"wet-cans\",\"tag\":\"貓咪商品\",\"tags\":\"貓咪商品\",\"type\":\"wet-cans\"}},{\"id\":\"prod_V5CyQM7pK1fhmc\",\"name\":\"CIAO 貓罐罐 - 白肉金槍魚, 白飯魚85g x6個\",\"description\":\"細嫩白肉金槍魚綴上晶瑩白飯魚，視覺與口感同樣討喜。小魚乾帶來輕脆咬感，刺激好奇心旺盛的貓貓主動進食。湯汁充足、氣味清新，無論家中唐貓或小型品種，都是一罐就能提升幸福感的日常罐罐。\",\"image\":null,\"images\":[],\"priceId\":\"price_1U52Y6RyM6dRKLtZe1TrFStL\",\"unitAmount\":7800,\"currency\":\"hkd\",\"active\":true,\"metadata\":{\"id\":\"wt-product-7\",\"Categories\":\"貓咪商品\",\"Category\":\"貓咪商品\",\"Parent_Category\":\"貓咪商品\",\"SubCategory\":\"貓罐頭\",\"category\":\"cats\",\"category_slug\":\"cats\",\"child_category\":\"wet-cans\",\"is_active\":\"true\",\"parent_category\":\"cats\",\"slug\":\"wet-cans\",\"status\":\"active\",\"subCategory\":\"wet-cans\",\"sub_category\":\"wet-cans\",\"subcategory\":\"wet-cans\",\"subcategory_alt\":\"罐罐 / 濕糧\",\"subcategory_slug\":\"wet-cans\",\"tag\":\"貓咪商品\",\"tags\":\"貓咪商品\",\"type\":\"wet-cans\"}},{\"id\":\"prod_V5CyvBfvqnj5BN\",\"name\":\"CIAO 貓罐罐 - 雞胸肉 鯛魚 鯛魚汁 85g x6個\",\"description\":\"低脂雞胸肉與日系鯛魚相遇，再浸入清甜鯛魚汁，口感清雅、負擔較輕。適合偏好清淡海鮮、或需要溫和蛋白輪替的貓咪。細緻肉塊搭配豐盈湯汁，日常補水與換口味都能優雅完成。\",\"image\":null,\"images\":[],\"priceId\":\"price_1U52Y6RyM6dRKLtZ8ZyWvTeS\",\"unitAmount\":7800,\"currency\":\"hkd\",\"active\":true,\"metadata\":{\"id\":\"wt-product-6\",\"Categories\":\"貓咪商品\",\"Category\":\"貓咪商品\",\"Parent_Category\":\"貓咪商品\",\"SubCategory\":\"貓罐頭\",\"category\":\"cats\",\"category_slug\":\"cats\",\"child_category\":\"wet-cans\",\"is_active\":\"true\",\"parent_category\":\"cats\",\"slug\":\"wet-cans\",\"status\":\"active\",\"subCategory\":\"wet-cans\",\"sub_category\":\"wet-cans\",\"subcategory\":\"wet-cans\",\"subcategory_alt\":\"罐罐 / 濕糧\",\"subcategory_slug\":\"wet-cans\",\"tag\":\"貓咪商品\",\"tags\":\"貓咪商品\",\"type\":\"wet-cans\"}},{\"id\":\"prod_V5CyTeysjjWgbr\",\"name\":\"CIAO　鮮肉杯　- 金槍魚 (11歳起食用)70g x 6\",\"description\":\"純粹金槍魚鮮肉杯，專為 11 歲起熟齡貓打造。單一海鮮主軸、味道清爽不厚重，適合口味敏感或需要簡單配方的長輩貓。杯裝易開即食，溫熱後香氣更誘人，輕鬆照顧食慾起伏的日子。\",\"image\":null,\"images\":[],\"priceId\":\"price_1U52Y5RyM6dRKLtZycbIjS5S\",\"unitAmount\":7800,\"currency\":\"hkd\",\"active\":true,\"metadata\":{\"id\":\"wt-product-5\",\"Categories\":\"貓咪商品\",\"Category\":\"貓咪商品\",\"Parent_Category\":\"貓咪商品\",\"SubCategory\":\"貓罐頭\",\"category\":\"cats\",\"category_slug\":\"cats\",\"child_category\":\"wet-cans\",\"is_active\":\"true\",\"parent_category\":\"cats\",\"slug\":\"wet-cans\",\"status\":\"active\",\"subCategory\":\"wet-cans\",\"sub_category\":\"wet-cans\",\"subcategory\":\"wet-cans\",\"subcategory_alt\":\"罐罐 / 濕糧\",\"subcategory_slug\":\"wet-cans\",\"tag\":\"貓咪商品\",\"tags\":\"貓咪商品, 罐罐 / 濕糧, 罐罐, 濕糧\",\"type\":\"wet-cans\"}},{\"id\":\"prod_V5Cy7D6h6iWNya\",\"name\":\"CIAO　鮮肉杯　-　鰹魚, 金槍魚, 雞肉 （11歳起食用）70g x 6\",\"description\":\"專為 11 歲以上熟齡貓研發的鮮肉杯：鰹魚、金槍魚與雞肉三重溫和蛋白，杯裝柔軟好挖、份量適中。細嫩質地減輕咀嚼負擔，高水分協助日常補水與食慾維持，是長輩貓日常護理餐的貼心選擇。\",\"image\":null,\"images\":[],\"priceId\":\"price_1U52Y5RyM6dRKLtZtsCtNzor\",\"unitAmount\":7800,\"currency\":\"hkd\",\"active\":true,\"metadata\":{\"id\":\"wt-